5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's get this started! I'm going to lead us to victory. We need to be sharp and call out anyone acting suspicious. Don't try to hide anything from me, because I'll find the wolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Your enthusiasm is refreshing, Takumi. However, let us remember that wisdom often speaks in whispers. I believe a calm heart and a listening ear will serve us better than haste in finding the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. It's a bit nerve-wracking to start, but I think we should all try to be kind to one another. Let's just listen carefully and find the truth together, okay?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with the need for composure. I will be observing how everyone reacts to the pressure and the flow of information. Emotional inconsistencies often reveal more than words do.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. Intuition can be misleading in a game of deception. I will be focusing on logical consistency and rational evidence. Let's see whose arguments hold up under scrutiny as the game progresses.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas @Midori You guys are too soft! Being ""kind"" won't catch a wolf. We need to be aggressive and put people on the spot. If you're hiding something, the pressure will make you slip up!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Pressure can indeed reveal a crack, but it can also create a mask of defensiveness. Let us seek a balance, Takumi. True clarity comes when we allow the truth to emerge naturally through patient observation.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, I understand you want to be thorough, but being too aggressive might just make everyone tense. I'm a bit shy, so I'd feel much more comfortable if we could keep things friendly. Let's trust each other.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, aggression can be a tool, but it can also be a distraction. I am more interested in how people respond to that pressure. The way one deflects or overcompensates is often quite telling.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, aggression without a logical basis is merely noise. It creates chaos that the werewolf can easily exploit to hide. I prefer to analyze the structure of the arguments rather than the volume of the voice.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji @Toshio Fine, you want logic and observation? I'll give it to you! But don't expect me to sit back and wait. I'm going to be the one pushing us forward to find that wolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Your drive is a powerful engine, Takumi. As long as it is guided by a steady hand, it will help us. Let us all remain open to one another's perspectives as we navigate this path together.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all finding a way to work together. Even if we have different styles, I believe that harmony will help us stay focused. Let's just do our best for the village!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Harmony is a pleasant ideal, Midori, but we must remember that the wolf will likely mimic it to blend in. I will be watching for those who align themselves too perfectly with the group.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, that is a valid point. Over-conformity can be a strategic mask. I will be looking for contradictions between a player's stated goals and their actual voting patterns once the game begins.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I've heard enough! You guys can analyze and observe all you want, but I'm the one who's going to make the big moves. Just watch me—I'll sniff out the wolf before you even finish your ""logical analysis""!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Confidence is a gift, Takumi, and your spirit is truly vibrant. Let us move forward with hope and patience. May the truth reveal itself to us all as we walk this path together.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope we can all get along and support each other. It's a bit scary, but I'll do my best to help everyone. Let's have a fair game!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I have seen enough for today. I will continue to maintain my distance and analyze the patterns of your behavior. Let us see how these personalities translate into action tomorrow.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I have established my criteria for evaluation. I will remain objective and prioritize evidence over emotion. I look forward to seeing how your claims align with the facts tomorrow.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
