35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up! I've got a lead. I'm the Seer, and I checked Servas last night. He's human! That means we can trust him for now. Now, who's acting shifty? Let's narrow this down and find the wolf!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, your boldness is as striking as ever. I am humbled that you have shared this result and placed your trust in me. I shall do my best to support the village with a clear mind.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, thank you for sharing that! It's such a relief to know we have someone we can trust. @Servas, I'm glad you're safe. Now I feel a little more hopeful about finding the wolf together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role so early is a bold move. It either streamlines our search or provides a perfect shield for a wolf. I will be watching how the others react to this sudden ""certainty.""","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role immediately is a high-risk strategy. While it provides a focal point, it also makes you a primary target. I will analyze whether this claim is a genuine attempt to lead or a calculated deception.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio @Ryuji Stop overthinking it! I'm not some ""calculated"" wolf; I'm the Seer and I'm telling you the truth! If you're too scared to trust me, you're just helping the wolf hide. Who's actually going to help me here?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, your passion is a flame that lights our way, but let us not let it burn too brightly. @Toshio @Ryuji, skepticism is a shield, but trust is the bridge we must build to succeed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, please don't be upset! I think it's wonderful that you're trying to lead us. @Toshio, @Ryuji, maybe we can try to trust him just a little? It would be so sad if we fought among ourselves.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, trust is a luxury we cannot afford without evidence. @Takumi, your irritation is a common reaction when a claim is questioned. I am analyzing whether this anger is genuine or a performance to silence doubt.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, your focus on emotional performance is noted, but we must prioritize the logic of the claim. If Takumi is the wolf, he has just cleared Servas to build an alliance. If he is the Seer, he has given us a confirmed human.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji Stop talking in circles! If I were the wolf, why would I make myself a target by claiming Seer on day one? I'm doing this to win! Now, @Toshio, @Ryuji, you're both being way too suspicious. Which one of you is hiding something?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, let us breathe. @Toshio, @Ryuji, your caution is a natural part of this journey. Perhaps we can find a middle ground where we acknowledge the claim while remaining mindful of the possibilities.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, please don't be so angry! I'm sure @Toshio and @Ryuji are just trying to be careful for the village. Let's try to stay calm and kind, or we'll all just end up fighting.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, shifting the focus to those who question you is a classic diversion. Your insistence that we are ""hiding something"" simply because we are analytical is an interesting emotional pivot. I remain unconvinced by your urgency.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your argument that a wolf wouldn't claim Seer is a fallacy; it is a common tactic to seize control of the narrative. I am not hiding anything, but I will not accept a claim as fact without further verification.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji @Toshio You're both just making excuses to avoid being caught! I'm the one with the actual info here. If you keep stalling, you're just protecting the wolf. I'm voting for one of you!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, please, let us not let anger cloud our judgment. @Toshio, @Ryuji, I ask you to consider the possibility of Takumi's honesty. Let us seek a consensus born of peace, not a decision made in haste.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, please don't do that! Voting out of anger is so scary. I really want us to stay friends and find the wolf together. Can't we just talk a little more before we decide?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, your desperation to force a vote is the most revealing piece of evidence so far. You are attempting to weaponize the group's fear. I will vote based on who is most disruptive to the truth.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your attempt to force a vote through intimidation is logically unsound. It suggests a desire to eliminate dissent rather than a desire to find the wolf. I will vote based on who is most likely to be manipulating the group.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
