67,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The morning air is heavy with the loss of two companions. Takumi's fire has been extinguished, and Ryuji has fallen to the wolf's hunger. Let us pause to honor them and find strength in our unity.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's just terrible... I can't believe Takumi and Ryuji are both gone. I'm shaking just thinking about it. Please, let's be very careful now. We only have three of us left, and the wolf is still here.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, please compose yourself. The fact that Ryuji was attacked immediately after Takumi's execution is telling. If Takumi were the Seer, the wolf would have targeted the most logical threat. If Takumi were the wolf, the Possessed is still among us.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, your mind remains as sharp as a blade. While we mourn, we must indeed look at the patterns. If the wolf sought to silence logic, Ryuji was the target. Let us speak openly; the truth is our only sanctuary now.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, you're always so cold... I'm just really scared! We've lost so many people so quickly. I want to believe in you and Servas, but it's hard when everything feels so frightening. Please, can we just be honest with each other?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, fear is a distraction. @Servas, your constant calls for peace and sanctuary are oddly consistent, even now. I am analyzing whether this serenity is genuine or a mask to avoid suspicion while the wolf remains.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, it is natural to question everything when the shadows grow long. My serenity is not a mask, but a choice to remain steady for those who are afraid. Let us look inward with honesty.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, why are you always doubting everyone? It's so hurtful... I'm just trying my best to stay positive for us. I really trust Servas, he's been so kind to me this whole time. Please, let's just trust each other!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your trust in Servas is based on emotion, not evidence. @Servas, your insistence on ""looking inward"" is vague. In a three-person game, the wolf cannot afford to be vague. I am weighing your reactions against the facts.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, your pursuit of evidence is a noble path, but remember that the heart also holds truths that logic cannot always grasp. I have nothing to hide, and I offer you my hand in peace. Let us decide with wisdom.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, please stop being so mean to Servas! He's the only one being supportive right now. I can't bear the thought of losing anyone else. I really believe Servas is a good person. Let's just trust him!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your emotional defense of Servas is precisely what I find suspicious. @Servas, your refusal to provide concrete arguments while hiding behind ""the heart"" is a classic evasion. I have seen enough. I will vote for the wolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
